msgid "Report a problem with PC5"
msgstr "Ilmoita PC5:n ongelmasta"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:58
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "Lähetä peli"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:59
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Valitse pelin kansio: se menee PC5:n INSTALL-kansioon, ja sitten PC5 "
"kysyy, asennetaanko se."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:61
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "Valitse kansio"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:63
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr ""
"Puhelin, joka ei osaa valita kansiota: kirjoita pelin kansion nimi ja "
"valitse sitten sen tiedostot."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "Valitse tiedostot"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:72
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "Pelit"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:72
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Päivitä"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:74 title/pc5_web_page.html:80
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:216 title/pc5_web_page.html:242
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Ladataan…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:77
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "Lokit"

#. Web page text.
#. Keep <b>...</b> and <code>...</code> around the same words.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:78
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Attach one to an issue on GitHub when a game has a problem: a game's "
"<b>Report a problem</b> above downloads its newest log and opens GitHub's "
"form with the game, PC5 and its settings filled in."
msgstr ""
"Liitä yksi GitHubin issueen, kun pelissä on ongelma: pelin <b>Ilmoita "
"ongelmasta</b> yllä lataa sen uusimman lokin ja avaa GitHubin lomakkeen, "
"johon peli, PC5 ja sen asetukset on täytetty."

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:65
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The game's folder name"
msgstr "Pelin kansion nimi"

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:73
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Find a game"
msgstr "Etsi peliä"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:109
msgctxt "web"
msgid "bytes"
msgstr "tavua"

#. Web page text.
